flowchart LR
    dev[Developer push] --> build
    subgraph ci[CI, every commit]
        build["Build: cached Docker layers"] --> unit[Unit tests]
        build --> lint[Lint + typecheck]
        build --> sast[SAST + dependency scan]
        unit --> gate{all green?}
        lint --> gate
        sast --> gate
    end
    gate -->|no, PR blocked| dev
    gate -->|yes, push| registry[("Image registry: signed with cosign")]
    subgraph staging
        deploy["Deploy: Helm"] --> e2e[E2E + smoke tests]
    end
    registry --> deploy
    e2e --> approve{release approved?}
    subgraph prod[production]
        canary[Canary 5%] --> slo{SLOs held 30 min?}
        slo -->|yes| full[Roll out 100%]
    end
    approve -->|yes| canary
    slo -->|no| rollback[Automatic rollback]